WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:06.720
Quarantine is a useful pattern when values are
questionable but not safely correctable The

00:00:06.747 --> 00:00:12.431
source remains intact Issue flags identify what
needs attention

00:00:14.179 --> 00:00:19.969
A view or table exposes the review subset After
review records

00:00:19.996 --> 00:00:25.644
can be corrected approved or excluded according to
policy This

00:00:25.657 --> 00:00:28.209
is often safer than automatic replacement
